  "body": "Once we finish un-partial-stating events, we update the `current_state_events` table to include the complete state of the room. However, that can race against the persistence of an event, which also updates this table - so we may end up with completely bogus \"current state\" data.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/7c6b2204d143550d81e5bf9612c4e69fe0866b4c/synapse/storage/controllers/persist_events.py#L384-L399\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/12988",
